@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Internal structure and responsibility allocation
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Example owner internal structure" {
 component "Public contract / validated intent" as C
 component "Application handler" as H
 component "Owned domain policy / values" as D
 interface "Required authority port" as A
 interface "Required persistence port" as S
 C --> H
 H --> D
 H --> A
 H --> S
}
note bottom of H
 Handler coordinates; domain preserves invariants;
 persistence mechanism supplies guarded coherent commit.
 No hidden external effect in constructors or observers.
end note

@enduml
